#: src/poltergeist/ControlFix.zig:194
msgid ""
"Read it with terminal_read first to see where it stopped: if it had not "
"finished, have it carry on (terminal_send it to continue or retry); if it "
"had finished, have it say one line that it is done (that line clears the "
"failure), or close it once it is no longer needed. Say in the group when "
"you have dealt with it."
msgstr ""
"请先 terminal_read 看它停在哪：没做完，就让它接着做（terminal_send "
"叫它继续或重试）；已经做完了，就让它回一句完成（这一句会消掉出错），或者在不再需要时关掉它。处理完在群里说一声。"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlFix.zig:195
msgid "For each terminal that failed: {1}"
msgstr "对每个出错的终端，{1}"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlFix.zig:196
msgid ""
"Decide whether your last turn finished: if not, carry on; if it did, say so "
"in one line."
msgstr "请判断上一轮做完没有：没做完就接着做；做完了就回一句完成。"

