msgstr "屏幕 {1} 分没动，{2} 分没调工具"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlRoom.zig:925
msgid "Started by hand: no status"
msgstr "手动启动，没接上状态"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlRoom.zig:926
msgid "Unknown CLI: no status"
msgstr "不认得的 CLI，状态未知"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlRoom.zig:964
msgid "This ends the {1} running in this terminal and starts it again through Polter, with its status hooks, going on with session {2} (last written {3} min ago)."
msgstr "会结束这个终端里正在运行的 {1}，再由 Polter 带状态钩子重启，并续上会话 {2}（{3} 分钟前写过）。"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlRoom.zig:965
msgid "This ends the {1} running in this terminal and starts it again through Polter, with its status hooks, going on with session {2}. That session was last written {3} min ago, well before its last tool call: if it was cleared since, what comes back is the conversation from before that."
msgstr "会结束这个终端里正在运行的 {1}，再由 Polter 带状态钩子重启，并续上会话 {2}。这个会话 {3} 分钟前写过，比它最后一次调工具早得多：如果之后清过上下文（/clear），续上的会是清之前的对话。"

#: src/poltergeist/ControlRoom.zig:966
msgid "This ends the {1} running in this terminal and starts it again through Polter, with its status hooks. Its session was not found, so it starts a new one."
msgstr "会结束这个终端里正在运行的 {1}，再由 Polter 带状态钩子重启。找不到它的会话，所以会开一个新会话。"

