msgid ""
"Only Polter's own screenshots go; nothing else in the folder is touched. The "
"AI can no longer list or open them."
msgstr ""
"只删 Polter 自己截的图，截图文件夹里别的文件不动。AI 从此列不出、打不开这些截"
"图。"

