msgid "Compact the task records?"
msgstr "压实任务记录？"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:285
msgid ""
"Each task keeps only where it stands now: title, owner, progress, open or "
"closed. The history of changes before today, at most %@, will be deleted. "
"This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"每个任务只留下当前状态：标题、负责人、进度、是否关闭。今天以前的变更历史（最"
"多 %@）将被删除，无法恢复。"

