"The history of task changes and the statistics page will no longer show "
"events before today."
msgstr "任务的变更历史和统计页从此看不到今天以前的事件。"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:289
msgid "Compact"
msgstr "压实"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:292
msgid "Clear shell history?"
msgstr "清理 Shell 历史？"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:294
msgid ""
"History files no saved project and no open pane uses will be deleted, at "
"most %@. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"将删除没有已保存项目、也没有打开着的分格在用的历史文件（最多 %@），无法恢复。"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:295
msgid "Panes opened from a project, and panes open now, keep their history."
msgstr "从项目打开的分格、现在开着的分格，历史都保留。"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:302
msgid ""
"The archive plugin's copies before today will be deleted, at most %@. This "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr "将删除归档插件今天以前的副本（最多 %@），无法恢复。"

#: windows/settings-shell/src/logs.rs:303
msgid ""
"This is the archive plugin's own copy of the chat; Polter's chat records are "
"not touched."
msgstr "这是归档插件另存的群聊，Polter 自己的群聊记录不受影响。"

