msgid "Its chat, task panel and brief are deleted with it, and cannot be recovered."
msgstr "群聊记录、任务面板和群简介会一起删掉，不能恢复。"

#: windows/control-room/src/confirm.rs:42
msgid "The project {} stays; it just no longer belongs to any group."
msgstr "项目 {} 留着，只是不再属于任何群。"

#: windows/control-room/src/confirm.rs:43
msgid "If you would rather not delete this much, archive it instead."
msgstr "不想删得这么干净，可以改为归档。"

#: windows/control-room/src/confirm.rs:44
msgid "Delete Group"
msgstr "删除群"

#: windows/control-room/src/confirm.rs:29
msgid "It goes into “Archived” at the bottom of the list, and you are not notified about it any more. Its chat, tasks, brief and project are all kept; right-click it in “Archived” and choose “Unarchive” to bring it back."
msgstr "它会收进列表底部的「已归档」，不再通知你。聊天记录、任务、群简介和项目都留着，在「已归档」里右键「取消归档」就回来。"

#: windows/control-room/src/confirm.rs:34
msgid "This group still has {} members and {} unfinished tasks. Deleting does not close their terminals, but they leave the group, and the unfinished tasks are deleted too."
msgstr "这个群里还有 {} 个成员，{} 件任务没做完。删除不会关掉它们的终端，但它们会离开这个群，没做完的任务也一起删掉。"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:28
msgid "{}'s brief"
msgstr "{} 的群简介"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:29
msgid "The group's supervisor and workers can all read this."
msgstr "群里的总管和 worker 都读得到这段话。"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:30
msgid "{} characters"
msgstr "{} 字"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:31
msgid "{} characters, not saved"
msgstr "{} 字，没保存"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:28
msgid "Asked the supervisor for a progress report"
msgstr "已请总管汇报进度"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:29
msgid "Asked the supervisor to close idle workers"
msgstr "已请总管关闭闲置的 worker"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:30
msgid "Not delivered: {}"
msgstr "没送出去：{}"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:31
msgid "Not delivered yet: {}. It will be tried again."
msgstr "还没送出去：{}。会再试。"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:32
msgid "Archived ({})"
msgstr "已归档 ({})"

#: windows/control-room/src/scene.rs:34
msgid "archived {}/{}"
msgstr "{} 月 {} 日归档"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:455
msgid "the supervisor's input line has text in it"
msgstr "总管的输入框里有字"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:456
msgid "somebody just typed in the supervisor's terminal"
msgstr "有人刚在总管终端里打过字"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:457
msgid "no agent is connected in the supervisor's terminal"
msgstr "总管终端里没有接上 agent"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:341
msgid "Records of a group by that name are still on disk. Pick another name."
msgstr "磁盘上还留着一个同名群的记录，换个名字吧。"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:342
msgid "Another Polter is renaming a group right now. Try again in a few seconds."
msgstr "另一个 Polter 正在给群改名，过几秒再试。"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:343
msgid "An earlier rename was left unfinished. Restart Polter, then try again."
msgstr "上次的改名没做完。重启 Polter 后再试。"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:344
msgid "The rename could not be finished now; it will be finished the next time Polter starts."
msgstr "这次改名没能做完，下次启动 Polter 时会做完。"

#: windows/control-room/src/act.rs:345
msgid "Deleted from the list, but some of its records could not be deleted."
msgstr "已从列表删除，但有记录没删掉。"
